cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Mangrove and land-cover classification of Hong Kong with Google Earth Engine"
abstract: >-
  Google Earth Engine script that classifies land cover in Hong Kong for 2021
  from a Landsat 8 surface-reflectance median composite and spectral indices
  (NDVI, NDMI, NDWI, BSI) with a Random Forest classifier, including accuracy
  assessment and wetland post-processing (JRC Global Surface Water, reservoirs,
  ALOS DSM elevation threshold and tidal ponds).
authors:
